{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/NYX_-_About_the_game.gif?t=1621263777\" /><br>Welcome to the darkest nightmare. Prepare to challenge a goddess!<br><br><i>NYX: The Awakening</i> is a blast of 80\u2019s retro nostalgia. Discover the decade that defined modern pop-culture. It doesn\u2019t matter if you\u2019re a nerd or a jock\u2014this game is an experience to remember!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/NYX_divider_violet3.png?t=1621263777\" /><br><br>Vicky was an ordinary teenager living in a typical American town\u2014Mystic, CT. <br>There was nothing unusual about her until the day she came to face the trial of NYX, the ancient deity of the night who turned her life into a living nightmare.<br><br>Help Vicky overcome dangerous traps and stand against nightmarish enemies. Hidden behind this shady fa\u00e7ade, the truth about her life waits to be discovered.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/NYX_-_Key_Features.gif?t=1621263777\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/NYX_bullet_point_pink_24x16.png?t=1621263777\" />Experience unique gameplay based on a color swapping mechanic<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/NYX_bullet_point_violet_24x16.png?t=1621263777\" />Face nightmarish creatures from another dimension and enjoy epic combat action<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/NYX_bullet_point_pink_24x16.png?t=1621263777\" />Solve challenging platform and environmental puzzles<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extr